9. Traceability
Requirements will be linked to their corresponding user stories and acceptance criteria to ensure that each requirement can be verified.

The detailed traceability matrix will be maintained in requirements/traceability-matrix.md.

The traceability process will help identify requirements that have no corresponding user story or acceptance criterion and ensure that the project's requirements are covered.
10. Conclusion
This Software Requirements Specification defines the proposed functionality, quality requirements, stakeholders, system interfaces, assumptions and constraints of the University Library Management System.

The document provides a foundation for future system design and prototyping. The requirements will be reviewed and updated when further information about library policies and stakeholder needs becomes available.
